    "directions": [
      "In a sauce pot, add water, once it's roaring boiled, add salt to taste, sugar, onions, cover it with the lid and cook it for 7-8 minutes until cooked well.",
      "Strain out the onions, transfer it to a mixer grinder jar and grind it smoothly.",
      "Keep it aside for further use.",
      "In a bowl, add chicken, salt to taste, oil, green chillies, ginger garlic paste, turmeric powder and mix it well.",
      "Keep it aside to marinate for 10-15 minutes.",
      "In a handi, add ghee, oil, once it's hot, add cumin seeds, green cardamom, bay leaf, cinnamon stick and let it splutter.",
      "Add marinated chicken and saute it for a while.",
      "Add prepared boiled onion paste and cook it well.",
      "Add green chillies, coriander powder, turmeric powder, degi red chili powder and saute it a minute.",
      "Add curd and simmer it for a minute, cover it with the lid and cook it for 5-6 minutes until cooked well.",
      "Add water, fresh coriander leaves, black cardamom & black peppercorns powder and let it simmer for a while.",
      "Finish it with some fried onions & cashew nuts paste and mix it well.",
      "Transfer it to a serving dish, garnish it with coriander sprig and boiled egg.",
      "Serve hot with roti."
    ],
